mini-browser (1.0.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release.
  * Tabbed browsing with navigation controls
  * Bookmark and history management
  * Download manager with progress tracking
  * Proxy configuration (HTTP / SOCKS5)
  * Multi-search-engine support
  * Dark theme
  * Developer tools (F12)
  * i18n support (gettext-based)

